{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>上周日（22日）是加拿大天王Justin Bieber美國索模妻子Hailey Bieber 30歲生日，而她今日就於社交網分享連串慶祝生日的照片。</p><p>照片中Hailey穿上金色比堅尼出海慶祝大晒索爆身材，而另一張是她換上另一身性感打扮與老公在煙花低下自拍，期間更咀嘴大晒恩愛，羨煞旁人！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.218109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:15.758807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:37:19.270942+00:00","content_hash":"09c796be5228fb7e9838a395cdd5fb33d7032c0f826423f61253179036562643","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}